"authorize full entropy credit for a cryptographic library. See the explicit "
"{ref}`F407 constructor <stm32f407-entropy-construction>` for its clock and "
"shutdown prerequisites. Other retained SDKs do not grant an entropy provider."
msgstr ""
"The entropy face supplies bounded, health-admitted source words. "
