#: docs/reference/api/io.md:259
msgid ""
"Task-only, one executor. acquire is a bounded, nonblocking handoff: success "
"proves the controller, DMA, IRQs, other masters and pin users quiescent, both"
" physical pins exclusively leased in reviewed open-drain GPIO mode, with both"
" lines released. Failure retains no lease or effects. drive only sinks LOW or"
" releases a pin; false never means drive HIGH. When scl_low is true, drive "
"establishes SCL LOW before changing SDA, including a retry from unknown "
"previous pin state. sample reads physical levels, not output latches. Methods"
" are bounded and preserve the lease on errors. release restores the saved "
"peripheral/pin ownership only on success; failure retains all lease/storage "
"responsibility. wait_until uses the injected clock's finite absolute domain "
"and reaches target or reports an error within a caller- proved finite bound, "
"even if the clock stops. Late waits cannot qualify an expired operation. No "
"callback may recursively operate on this session or run a transaction. The "
"adapter must verify reviewed open-drain, pull-up, voltage and two-pin "
"authorization facts before acquire."
msgstr ""
"Task-only, one executor. acquire is a bounded, nonblocking handoff: success "
"proves the controller, DMA, IRQs, other masters and pin users quiescent, both"
" physical pins exclusively leased in reviewed open-drain GPIO mode, with both"
" lines released. Failure retains no lease or effects. drive only sinks LOW or"
" releases a pin; false never means drive HIGH. When scl_low is true, drive "
"establishes SCL LOW before changing SDA, including a retry from unknown "
"previous pin state. sample reads physical levels, not output latches. Methods"
" are bounded and preserve the lease on errors. release restores the saved "
"peripheral/pin ownership only on success; failure retains all lease/storage "
"responsibility. wait_until uses the injected clock's finite absolute domain "
"and reaches target or reports an error within a caller- proved finite bound, "
"even if the clock stops. Late waits cannot qualify an expired operation. No "
"callback may recursively operate on this session or run a transaction. The "
"adapter must verify reviewed open-drain, pull-up, voltage and two-pin "
"authorization facts before acquire."

