"pulse count. Without a trusted completion timestamp, completion first "
"observed at or after the request deadline reports TIMEOUT, even if DMA is "
"already complete. This conservative observation rule promises no physical "
"execution-time bound and never relaxes the required source drain."
msgstr ""
