"establish a valid prefix. A successful window reports exactly sample_count. "
"After successful ordinary completion, another explicitly prepared submission "
"may begin; an explicit stop or latched fault requires cold "
"close/reinitialization. Provider checks context, fixed frame, region and "
"overlap with all cold descriptors/MMIO before admission. The complete duty "
